            '!@!Helps!@!\n' ...
            'There are several levels of help on the main window and on the next level \n' ...
            'windows.\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'The quickest and simplest facility is provided by pop-up helps. When the \n' ...
            'mouse is moved over an object, usually a "balloon help" pops up with the \n' ...
            'most essential information. Exceptions are "patches" (colored areas in \n' ...
            'block diagrams) and axes which do not yet have this possibility in MATLAB \n' ...
