            'give warnings if they are not.\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'The "Import" procedure checks the type of the data: they must be \n' ...
            '''tiddata'' or ''fiddata'' objects, or maybe ''iddata'' objects (see \n' ...
            'System Identification Toolbox, V5.x or later). The first two types of \n' ...
            'objects can be created by the functions "tiddata" and "fiddata" from your \n' ...
            'own vectors - see "Help / Getting Started... / Using Time Domain Data", or \n' ...
