            'fill in the "Frequencies" and/or the "PeriodLength" property, e.g. \n' ...
            '\n' ...
            '     data.periodlength = 0.03;\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'and/or\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            '     data.frequencies = 1e3*[1:2:19];\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'If  the data of more than one experiments are used, and measurements are \n' ...
