            '!@!User Levels and Signal Types!@!\n' ...
            'One of the most powerful new features is the user''s freedom to choose the \n' ...
            'complexity level of data processing.\n' ...
            'Signal type "All" means that the user may throw arbitrary input-output \n' ...
