            '!@!Using Freq. Domain Data!@!\n' ...
            'Example: open "Read Freq. Domain Data", "Get data", and import data with \n' ...
            'the choices "From File", "Browse demos". Then you can select data from \n' ...
            'supported files. A good choice is "bandpass.mat", variable \n' ...
            '"bandpass_synch". After viewing the plot, Close the Read Frequency Domain \n' ...
