            '\n' ...
            'This block is enabled only if "UserLevel" is "Interactive" or higher.\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'Meaning of the color of the block:\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            '- gray means block disabled for some reason (e.g. because UserLevel is \n' ...
