            '1) Forward the signal to the output arrow of the block diagram\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            '2) Save the signal to the workspace of to a file.\n' ...
            '!@!Forward in the block diagram!@!\n' ...
            'The standard way is to forward the signal to the output arrow of the block \n' ...
