   case {'essd_uic_stsgrb(4)'}
      Name='DITS';
      LongHelp=sprintf( ...
         [ ...
            'A Discrete Interval Three-level (Ternary) Sequence is a signal very \n' ...
            'similar to a DIBS, except it may have in excess to 2 levels: Apeak, and \n' ...
            '-Apeak also 0. It may change its value at discrete time instants only. The \n' ...
            'signal is designed to approximate the given spectrum. Every second and/or \n' ...
            'third harmonic can be exactly suppressed if the proper option under \n' ...
            '"Frequencies" is selected.\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'For details in setting the design parameters, see the Help / Help on \n' ...
