   case {'essd_uic_adjustpb'}
      Name='Adjust freqs';
      LongHelp=sprintf( ...
         [ ...
            'This button checks consistency of parameter settings in the window, and \n' ...
            'makes adjustments in freqs, fmin, fmax if necessary, to select frequencies \n' ...
            'on the DFT grid. The sample number and the generator clock frequency are \n' ...
            'kept constant.\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'For multisine, DIBS and DITS, the calculated frequency vector is adjusted \n' ...
            'to the DFT grid set by the given parameters (clock frequency, number of \n' ...
            'samples). fmin and fmax are then approximately set, covering the DFT \n' ...
            'points selected by fmin and fmax. If necessary, freqs is set last to its \n' ...
            'true value with the given parameters.\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'If freqs is a small number, the algorithm selects the appropriate number \n' ...
            'of harmonics on the DFT grid from the possible ones. This sometimes \n' ...
            'results in a funny set of frequencies. If you want to have the maximum \n' ...
