            'For multisine, DIBS and DITS, this button checks consistency of parameter \n' ...
            'settings in the window, and makes adjustments in the clock frequency and \n' ...
            'the number of samples if necessary. In this adjustment, fmin, fmax and \n' ...
            'freqs are kept approximately constant. The aim is to assure that just one \n' ...
            'period, or an integer number of periods is generated.\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'First the clock frequency is checked, and adjusted to 4*fmax if it is \n' ...
