            'them with default settings. The period length of the signal will also be \n' ...
            'automatically determined, and those frequency lines are kept which\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            '- are closest in frequency to the frequencies given in the input object if \n' ...
            'the excitation frequencies are given, or\n' ...
