            'this purpose.\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'However, if a z-domain model is sought, we better "simulate" the \n' ...
            'half-sample delay and the amplitude distortion of the ZOH. This way, we \n' ...
            'obtain "ZOH" data. This compensation can be automatically done with the \n' ...
            'GUI, by switching on this option. The bandlimited measurement of the \n' ...
            'output eliminates overlapping by straight sampling. We cannot compensate \n' ...
