            'saved into a MAT-file (please use the extension .MAT for these files).\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'You probably want to replay your actions later. This will only be \n' ...
            'successful if you start the GUI from exactly the same state. Therefore, at \n' ...
            'the beginning of each history record, we suggest to do some state setting. \n' ...
            'Push RECORD, and do the following: \n' ...
            '\n' ...
            '1) "File / Clear / Whole GUI", and \n' ...
            '\n' ...
            '2) "UserLevel / Interactive" or "UserLevel / Automatic", as you prefer.\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'Now you can record your actions. When you are ready, push STOP, then \n' ...
            'select "File / Save history as...", and give a file name with the extension \n' ...
            '.MAT.\n' ...
            '\n' ...
            'It is also possible to automatically load the contents of a MAT-file to \n' ...
            'the workspace before your actions if you want. To do this, push STOP, \n' ...
